\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. CHRIST, who knows all His sheep,
\par Will all in safety keep;
\par He will not loose His blood,
\par Nor interscession:
\par Nor we the purchased good
\par Of His dear passion.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I know my God is just,
\par To Him I wholly trust;
\par All that I have, and am,
\par All that I hope for:
\par All's sure and seen to Him,
\par Which I here grope for.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lord Jesus, take my spirit,
\par I trust Thy life and merit;
\par Take home this wandering sheep,
\par For Thou hast sought it:
\par This soul in safety keep,
\par For Thou hast bought it.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

